<title>SWITZERLAND: Adecco acquires Australia's ICON.</title>
<headline>Adecco acquires Australia's ICON.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Temporary employment firm Adecco SA, created from the merger of Ecco SA and Asia SA, said it had acquired ICON Recruitment, one of the largest and fastest-growing personnel services firms in Australia.  </p>
<p>ICON Recruitment was founded in 1988, has annual sales of A$465 million and offices in Sydney, Melbourne and Adelaide. More than 600 information specialists are currently working on a contract basis at customers.</p>
<p>Bob Watson, president of ICON, will continue in this position, and also be responsible for Adecco's business unit, Information Technology in Australia and South East Asia.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
